          {
            "description": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev 5 controls implemented by cli.",
            "implemented-requirements": [
              {
                "control-id": "ac-3.3",
                "description": "The client doesn't rely on the DS having enforced the policy. It decides with the same function before it adds a member or sends, and an invitee refuses a room whose ceiling is above its own clearance. A commit the DS sequenced against the rules freezes the room on that client (integrity hold).",
