              {
                "control-id": "ac-4",
                "description": "Receivers check the same rule again: a message above the ceiling, or from a sender whose credential doesn't cover its marking, is quarantined instead of shown. Forwarding between rooms keeps the original marking, so a destination whose ceiling is lower refuses the message and the refusal is logged. Attachments can't be forwarded between rooms yet (Q18).",
