        "description": "Pulls the sealed archive copy of every message into an append-only store. Holds no private key; opens a record only against a DS-logged permit.",
        "title": "GARBLE records custodian",
        "type": "software",
        "uuid": "e0423a47-3b98-5e3e-807e-1c61bac18b79"
