                "control-id": "ac-4",
                "description": "A message goes into a room only if its marking is within the room ceiling. The marking rides in the MLS-authenticated data of every application message, so the DS reads it without reading the content, refuses a message above the ceiling and logs the refusal with a reason code. Entries about a room are readable only by users cleared for that room's marking.",
