        "description": "Sequences MLS messages and handshakes, runs the shared policy on every one, and logs each decision. Operators run it; they aren't room members.",
        "title": "GARBLE delivery service",
        "type": "software",
        "uuid": "e3448425-04b7-5b23-892a-8f4aa2da8b6e"
